---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Legal notice of the Austrian gross-to-net calculator: publisher, editorial line, hosting, liability for calculation results, copyright and how to reach us." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Responsible for content: {AUTHOR_NAME}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Editorial line</h2>
    <p>{SITE_URL} provides independent information on pay, wage tax, social insurance and benefits in Austria, with free calculators. It is not linked to any political party, interest group or payroll company.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>No advice, no guarantee</h2>
    <p>The calculators give <strong>estimates</strong> based on the official 2026 values listed with source and date in the <a href={route('method', lang)}>calculation method</a>. They replace neither your payslip nor a decision of the tax office, ÖGK or AMS, nor tax or legal advice. Although tested automatically against the Finance Ministry calculator, we accept no liability for decisions based solely on a result from this site. Please report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the calculator</h2>
    <p>The gross-to-net calculator can be embedded free of charge in an iframe with a visible link: see <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed the calculator</a>.</p>
    <h2>Copyright</h2>
    <p>Texts, graphics and code are protected by copyright. Short quotes with a link to the original page are welcome. Legal texts and official values are public and quoted with their source.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>What you enter never leaves your browser. The publisher records no personal data. Visits are measured with Google Analytics, which sets audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising; stability is checked with Microsoft Clarity in cookie-free mode. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>.</p>
    <p class="text-sm">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
